classDiagram
    OrderCommandService --> OrderCommandStore : register immutable policy and claim
    OrderCommandService --> OrderCompensationWorkflow : saved compensation policy
    OrderCompensationWorkflow --> CreditCommandGateway : initial execution once
    OrderCompensationWorkflow --> OrderCompensationJournal : observation or abandon
    OrderCompensationWorkflow --> OrderTransitionServices : atomic local finalization
    OrderCompensationJournal --> OrderCommandStore : owner and generation fence
    OrderCompensationJournal --> CommandOutbox : atomic compensation intent
    OrderCompensationJournal --> ResultInbox : deduplicate committed Credit result
    CommandOutbox --> OrderOutboxDispatcher : durable publication retry
    OrderOutboxDispatcher --> CreditCompensationPublisher : opt-in PubSub adapter
    GoogleOIDCResultReceiver --> OrderCompensationJournal : confirm reverse or fence
    OrderLifecycleScheduler --> OrderCompensationJournal : due expired-lease commands
    note for CreditCompensationPublisher "ADR-055 explicit gate; default off; cloud rollout separate"
